-- One worker's status poller is held while the other one fails before its request: the query ends with the injected
-- error of the failed poller (before the fix it waited until its time limit and failed with TIMEOUT_EXCEEDED).
┌─error──────────┬─poller_failure_logged─┐
│ FAULT_INJECTED │                     1 │
└────────────────┴───────────────────────┘
